+/-- Beginning does not tell apart what the two-way core does not: the case of `«生于逆核下不变»` on the
+two-way core, which lies within the core of the converse net (`«位核含于逆核»`). -/
+theorem «生于位核下不变» {R E : «际» α} (hE : «类» E) {y y' : α} (hk : «位核» R E y y')
+    (hy : «生» R E y) : «生» R E y' :=
+  «生于逆核下不变» hE («位核含于逆核» R E y y' hk) hy
+
 /-- So beginning and ending are read off the two-way core: for a class `E`, what its two-way core
